{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50250","headline":"童子山 · 李翔","name":"童子山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"童子山形也不孤，势疑高拱从（耸）（僊）都。\n云生石肘如擎帔，月到岩心似捧壼。\n岂可绕坛操鳯节，争教侍（持）烛秉麟须。\n（项云「侍」字似不误，犹「侍酒」、「侍书」之「侍」也。\n）桑田若更成东海，始肯随师化此躯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}